-```text
-npc/vsrc/riscv32/
-  common/          package、配置、公共类型
-  core/
-    frontend/      predictor、IFU、I-cache、fetch buffer
-    backend/       rename、ROB、schedule、execute、LSU、commit
-    memory/        cache adapter、TLB、MMU、PMA/PMP
-  system/          interconnect、adapter、peripheral
